      "value": "I think that technically it’s not difficult to implement. When we create an instance of the world, we set the access level: «Friends», «Friends+», «Private», etc. In the same list, game creators can add the Trust Rank: «Users», «Known Users», etc. This is a further development of the Trust and Safety system introduced by the developers. Everyone will be able to configure an environment in VRChat, in which he will be most comfortable.",
